          "value": "<svg><polygon points=\"651.1768188476562,532.1157836914062 2186.604736328125,542.3023681640625 2184.752685546875,543.8639526367188 2170.6708984375,539.2642211914062 2072.43701171875,5624.8193359375 313.0699157714844,5358.86865234375 763.1405639648438,1860.592041015625 1284.8133544921875,1758.30322265625 630.1651611328125,1532.0692138671875 650.6229248046875,1511.6114501953125\"></polygon></svg>"
